// The spruce's LOD chain and budget. Twigs with their needle sprays become
// cards baked from a small library of exemplar twigs from full detail on,
// so even the hero level draws each twig in a few alpha-cut quads; sprays
// on thicker shoots stay individual, thinned with their area kept. Budgets
// count the triangles drawn (instances included) and the bytes of the
// level's instanced GLB with its textures.
